      <activity id="78798381-6eeb-533c-84f0-5e246c29353c" activityNameId="def385ed-d913-51f0-8207-c051cddee8ee" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dismantling, CRT screen, mechanically, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dismantling, CRT screen, mechanically, at plant
manual dismantling plus subsequent shredding/separation procedure, based on common transfer coefficients for both steps. Data from literature and from own experiences in Switzerland.;
UUID: 92b4d38c-f9fa-4fe4-901f-6362f490ed74
This dataset represents the mechanical treatment of a WEEE devices in Switzerland. Two process steps are included: manual depollution and the mechanical treatment (shredder) of the remaining part.
Location: European data, used as average for global situation
Technology: 4-step-procedure (shredder - separation - shredder - separation) as used currently often in Europe
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature and own experiences 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_92b4d38c-f9fa-4fe4-901f-6362f490ed74.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
